{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">中年好聲音4》6位「動物歌手」周志康、羅天宇、劉佩玥、姚兵、黃建東和莫家淦日前齊齊舉行個唱，陣容鼎盛，吸引大批圈中好友及粉絲入場支持。其中周志康（Daniel）在台上大解放，完美展現狂野與溫馨的雙重魅力，令全場氣氛High爆！</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"onlylovemily_1790856129_3998307446296256987_357316.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026vXy9vZ9PPy1790907185.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"onlylovemily_1790856129_3998307446296256987_357316.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">事後周志康在社交網分享演唱會的精彩點滴。相中可見，他與好兄弟羅天宇戴上型格黑超，在燈光閃爍的舞台上落力飆唱。為配合快歌與Rock的環節，周志康更單穿一件黑色貼身背心上陣，大方展露結實的手臂肌肉線條，魅力爆燈！兩人更索性坐在舞台邊緣與台下觀眾近距離互動，令全場尖叫聲不斷，氣氛持續高漲。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"danielchau928_1790870147_3998428156030985569_144935779.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026yFF2KJVeYf1790907186.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"danielchau928_1790870147_3998428156030985569_144935779.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">當晚他的家人，包括哥哥周志文、太太以及兩位寶貝囡囡都有親身到場，化身「最強粉絲」在台下落力打氣。一家人更在後台拍下溫馨大合照，畫面充滿滿滿的愛。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"danielchau928_1790870147_3998428144588850323_144935779.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026NAv9xf0ZfP1790907186.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"danielchau928_1790870147_3998428144588850323_144935779.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"danielchau928_1790870147_3998428134958828353_144935779.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026oSuPAi4k6o1790907186.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"danielchau928_1790870147_3998428134958828353_144935779.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"onlylovemily_1790856129_3998307436431375693_357316.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026IqAh036iej1790907186.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"onlylovemily_1790856129_3998307436431375693_357316.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">今次個唱對於周志康來說絕對是一次難忘的回憶，他激動發文分享感受：「真係唱到冇晒力，但爽到爆！快歌同Rock嘅環節，同我兩位好兄弟羅天宇、劉威煌分別合唱《獨家試唱》同《失魂》，兩個字：盡興！」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">他更特別感謝台下觀眾的熱情：「台上火花四濺，台下觀眾嘅熱情更加係燃燒全場🔥 感受到你哋每一聲歡呼、每一份能量，真係令我哋愈唱愈癲！多謝每一位入場嘅你，多謝我嘅兄弟，今晚呢個回憶，我哋一齊寫低咗。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T04:39:05.781920+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":524,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}